        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 87005-221714,  Tribeca Barn Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Tribeca Barn Door Pull Set pairs the stunning Tribeca Pull with a Modern Flush Pull. This set comes with everything you'll need to thru-bolt it on your sliding door including one door pull and a matching flush pull. The Tribeca Sliding Barn Door Set is available in a wide array of finish colors. It is made for doors up to 1-3/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSee the Entire <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Tribeca\"><b>Emtek Tribeca Collection</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Tribeca Door Pull and Flush Pull Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Total Length: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Overall Height: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Overall Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Overall Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Center to Center Height: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Cut-Out Height: 10-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Cut-Out Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Cup Height: 10-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Cup Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-87005-221714-specifications.pdf?v=1704262420\"><b>Emtek 87005-221714 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
